('privacy', 'Privacy Policy', '<div class="space-y-8"><div class="text-center border-b border-gray-200 pb-8"><h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Privacy Policy</h1><p class="text-lg text-gray-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto">Your privacy is important to us. This Privacy Policy explains how Trunc collects, uses, and protects your information when you use our URL shortener service, including link creation, analytics tracking, and click data collection.</p><p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mt-4"><strong>Last updated:</strong> January 16, 2026</p></div><div class="space-y-10"><section><h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-4">1. Information We Collect</h2><h3 class="text-xl font-medium text-gray-800 mb-3">1.1 Account and Profile Information</h3><ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-gray-700 mb-6"><li><strong>Registration Data:</strong> Name, email address, username, and encrypted password</li><li><strong>Profile Details:</strong> Optional profile photo, company name, and bio</li><li><strong>Authentication:</strong> API keys, OAuth tokens, and session identifiers</li><li><strong>Payment Information:</strong> Billing address, payment method (processed securely by Stripe), and subscription tier</li></ul><h3 class="text-xl font-medium text-gray-800 mb-3">1.2 URL and Link Data</h3><ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-gray-700 mb-6"><li><strong>Original URLs:</strong> Long URLs you submit for shortening</li><li><strong>Short Codes:</strong> Generated or custom short link aliases</li><li><strong>Link Metadata:</strong> Custom titles, descriptions, and tags you assign</li><li><strong>Destination URLs:</strong> Target pages your short links redirect to</li><li><strong>Link Settings:</strong> Expiration dates, password protection, and access controls</li><li><strong>QR Codes:</strong> Generated QR codes associated with your links</li></ul><h3 class="text-xl font-medium text-gray-800 mb-3">1.3 Click and Analytics Data</h3><p class="text-gray-700 mb-2">When someone clicks on your shortened links, we automatically collect:</p><ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-gray-700 mb-6"><li><strong>Visitor IP Address:</strong> Used for geolocation and fraud detection</li><li><strong>Geographic Data:</strong> Country, region, city derived from IP address</li><li><strong>Device Information:</strong> Device type (desktop, mobile, tablet), operating system, and screen resolution</li><li><strong>Browser Data:</strong> Browser name, version, and language preferences</li><li><strong>Referrer Information:</strong> Website or source that referred the click</li><li><strong>Timestamp:</strong> Exact date and time of each click</li><li><strong>User Agent String:</strong> Technical browser and device identifier</li></ul><h3 class="text-xl font-medium text-gray-800 mb-3">1.4 API Usage Data</h3><ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-gray-700 mb-6"><li>API endpoint requests and responses</li><li>Rate limiting and quota usage</li><li>Authentication attempts and API key usage</li><li>Webhook deliveries and failures</li></ul><h3 class="text-xl font-medium text-gray-800 mb-3">1.5 Service Usage and Technical Data</h3><ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-gray-700"><li>Dashboard interactions and feature usage patterns</li><li>Bulk operations and file uploads</li><li>Team collaboration activities</li><li>Custom domain configurations</li><li>Integration settings and third-party connections</li><li>Server logs, error reports, and diagnostic data</li></ul></section><section><h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-4">2. How We Use Your Information</h2><h3 class="text-xl font-medium text-gray-800 mb-3">2.1 Core Service Operation</h3><ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-gray-700 mb-6"><li><strong>URL Shortening:</strong> Create, store, and redirect shortened URLs</li><li><strong>Link Management:</strong> Organize, edit, and delete your links</li><li><strong>Analytics Generation:</strong> Provide real-time and historical click statistics</li><li><strong>Account Management:</strong> Authenticate users and manage subscriptions</li></ul><h3 class="text-xl font-medium text-gray-800 mb-3">2.2 Analytics and Insights</h3><ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-gray-700 mb-6"><li>Generate geographic heatmaps showing click locations</li><li>Provide device and browser distribution charts</li><li>Track referrer sources and traffic channels</li><li>Calculate click-through rates and engagement metrics</li><li>Identify trending links and performance patterns</li></ul><h3 class="text-xl font-medium text-gray-800 mb-3">2.3 Security and Fraud Prevention</h3><ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-gray-700 mb-6"><li>Detect and block malicious URLs and phishing attempts</li><li>Prevent spam and abuse of our service</li><li>Monitor for unusual traffic patterns and bot activity</li><li>Enforce rate limits and API quotas</li><li>Protect against DDoS attacks and service disruptions</li></ul><h3 class="text-xl font-medium text-gray-800 mb-3">2.4 Service Improvement</h3><ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-gray-700"><li>Analyze aggregated usage patterns to improve features</li><li>Test new functionality and A/B experiments</li><li>Optimize link redirection performance</li><li>Enhance dashboard user experience</li><li>Develop new analytics capabilities</li></ul></section><section><h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-4">3. Information Sharing and Third Parties</h2><h3 class="text-xl font-medium text-gray-800 mb-3 text-green-600">We do NOT sell your personal information or click data.</h3><p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">We share limited information only in these specific circumstances:</p><h3 class="text-xl font-medium text-gray-800 mb-3">3.1 Service Providers</h3><ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-gray-700 mb-6"><li><strong>Cloud Hosting:</strong> AWS/GCP for infrastructure (encrypted data storage)</li><li><strong>CDN:</strong> Cloudflare for global link redirection performance</li><li><strong>Payment Processing:</strong> Stripe for secure payment handling (PCI-compliant)</li><li><strong>Email Service:</strong> SendGrid for transactional emails and notifications</li><li><strong>Analytics:</strong> Internal analytics only - no third-party analytics tools</li></ul><h3 class="text-xl font-medium text-gray-800 mb-3">3.2 Your Link Visitors</h3><p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">When you share analytics publicly or embed analytics widgets, visitors can see:</p><ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-gray-700 mb-6"><li>Aggregated click counts and geographic distributions</li><li>Public statistics you choose to display</li><li>No personally identifiable information about individual clickers</li></ul><h3 class="text-xl font-medium text-gray-800 mb-3">3.3 Legal Requirements</h3><ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-gray-700 mb-6"><li>Comply with valid court orders, subpoenas, or legal processes</li><li>Respond to law enforcement requests with proper authorization</li><li>Protect against fraud, security threats, or terms violations</li></ul><h3 class="text-xl font-medium text-gray-800 mb-3">3.4 Business Transfers</h3><p class="text-gray-700">In the event of a merger, acquisition, or asset sale, user data may be transferred. We will notify you via email and provide opt-out options.</p></section><section><h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-4">4. Data Security and Protection</h2><h3 class="text-xl font-medium text-gray-800 mb-3">4.1 Security Measures</h3><ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-gray-700 mb-6"><li><strong>Encryption:</strong> TLS 1.3 for all data transmission, AES-256 for data at rest</li><li><strong>Access Controls:</strong> Role-based permissions and multi-factor authentication</li><li><strong>Database Security:</strong> Encrypted PostgreSQL with connection pooling and firewall rules</li><li><strong>API Security:</strong> Rate limiting, key rotation, and request signing</li><li><strong>Link Scanning:</strong> Automated malware and phishing detection on destination URLs</li><li><strong>Regular Audits:</strong> Security penetration testing and vulnerability assessments</li><li><strong>Incident Response:</strong> 24/7 security monitoring and breach notification procedures</li></ul><h3 class="text-xl font-medium text-gray-800 mb-3">4.2 Data Isolation</h3><p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">Your data is isolated and protected:</p><ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-gray-700"><li>Each account has separate database records and access controls</li><li>Analytics data is aggregated and anonymized for internal use</li><li>Custom domains are isolated with dedicated SSL certificates</li><li>API keys are hashed and cannot be retrieved in plain text</li></ul><div class="bg-yellow-50 border border-yellow-200 rounded-lg p-4 mt-4"><p class="text-yellow-900"><strong>Important:</strong> While we implement industry-leading security measures, no system is 100% secure. We cannot guarantee absolute protection against unauthorized access. Please use strong passwords and enable two-factor authentication.</p></div></section><section><h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-4">5. Your Privacy Rights and Controls</h2><h3 class="text-xl font-medium text-gray-800 mb-3">5.1 Data Access and Portability</h3><p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">You can access and export your data at any time:</p><ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-gray-700 mb-6"><li><strong>Dashboard Access:</strong> View all your links, analytics, and settings</li><li><strong>Data Export:</strong> Download CSV/JSON exports of all your links and click data</li><li><strong>API Access:</strong> Programmatically retrieve your data via our REST API</li><li><strong>Bulk Downloads:</strong> Export analytics reports with custom date ranges</li></ul><h3 class="text-xl font-medium text-gray-800 mb-3">5.2 Data Correction and Management</h3><ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-gray-700 mb-6"><li>Edit link titles, descriptions, and metadata at any time</li><li>Update account information and profile settings</li><li>Modify link settings (expiration, passwords, access controls)</li><li>Correct any inaccurate information in your profile</li></ul><h3 class="text-xl font-medium text-gray-800 mb-3">5.3 Data Deletion</h3><p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">You have complete control over your data deletion:</p><ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-gray-700 mb-6"><li><strong>Individual Links:</strong> Delete links instantly from your dashboard</li><li><strong>Bulk Deletion:</strong> Select multiple links for batch deletion</li><li><strong>Account Deletion:</strong> Request full account deletion via settings</li><li><strong>Deletion Timeline:</strong> Data permanently deleted within 30 days of request</li><li><strong>Backup Retention:</strong> Encrypted backups retained for 90 days for recovery</li></ul><h3 class="text-xl font-medium text-gray-800 mb-3">5.4 Regional Privacy Rights</h3><div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 mb-6"><div class="bg-blue-50 p-4 rounded-lg"><h4 class="font-semibold text-blue-900 mb-2">GDPR (European Union)</h4><ul class="text-sm text-blue-800 space-y-1"><li>• Right to access your data</li><li>• Right to rectification</li><li>• Right to erasure ("right to be forgotten")</li><li>• Right to data portability</li><li>• Right to restrict processing</li><li>• Right to object</li></ul></div><div class="bg-green-50 p-4 rounded-lg"><h4 class="font-semibold text-green-900 mb-2">CCPA (California)</h4><ul class="text-sm text-green-800 space-y-1"><li>• Know what data we collect</li><li>• Delete your personal data</li><li>• Opt-out of data "sales" (we don''t sell)</li><li>• Non-discrimination for exercising rights</li></ul></div></div><p class="text-gray-700">To exercise these rights, contact <a href="mailto:privacy@urlshorter.com" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline font-semibold">privacy@urlshorter.com</a>. We respond within 30 days.</p></section><section><h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-4">6. Cookies and Tracking Technologies</h2><h3 class="text-xl font-medium text-gray-800 mb-3">6.1 Cookies We Use</h3><div class="space-y-4 mb-6"><div class="border-l-4 border-blue-500 pl-4"><h4 class="font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-1">Essential Cookies (Required)</h4><p class="text-sm text-gray-600">Session management, authentication, CSRF protection. Cannot be disabled.</p></div><div class="border-l-4 border-green-500 pl-4"><h4 class="font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-1">Functional Cookies (Optional)</h4><p class="text-sm text-gray-600">Remember your preferences, dashboard layout, and settings.</p></div><div class="border-l-4 border-purple-500 pl-4"><h4 class="font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-1">Analytics Cookies (Optional)</h4><p class="text-sm text-gray-600">Track dashboard usage to improve user experience. Can be disabled in settings.</p></div></div><h3 class="text-xl font-medium text-gray-800 mb-3">6.2 Link Click Tracking</h3><p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">We do NOT use cookies on short link redirects. Instead, we use:</p><ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-gray-700 mb-4"><li>Server-side logging (IP, user agent, referrer)</li><li>No persistent tracking across websites</li><li>No third-party tracking pixels</li><li>Respect for Do Not Track (DNT) browser signals</li></ul><h3 class="text-xl font-medium text-gray-800 mb-3">6.3 Cookie Control</h3><p class="text-gray-700">Manage cookies via: Dashboard Settings → Privacy → Cookie Preferences</p></section><section><h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-4">7. Data Retention and Lifecycle</h2><h3 class="text-xl font-medium text-gray-800 mb-3">7.1 Active Account Data</h3><ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-gray-700 mb-6"><li><strong>Links:</strong> Retained indefinitely while your account is active</li><li><strong>Click Analytics:</strong> Stored for the duration of your subscription</li><li><strong>Account Data:</strong> Retained while account is active</li></ul><h3 class="text-xl font-medium text-gray-800 mb-3">7.2 Data Deletion Timeline</h3><ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-gray-700 mb-6"><li><strong>Individual Link Deletion:</strong> Immediate (30-day soft delete with recovery)</li><li><strong>Account Cancellation:</strong> Links remain active for 30 days, then archived</li><li><strong>Account Deletion Request:</strong> All data deleted within 30 days</li><li><strong>Inactive Accounts:</strong> Free accounts inactive for 2 years may be deleted</li></ul><h3 class="text-xl font-medium text-gray-800 mb-3">7.3 Legal Retention</h3><p class="text-gray-700">We may retain certain data to comply with legal obligations (tax records, fraud investigations) for up to 7 years.</p></section><section><h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-4">8. International Data Transfers</h2><p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">Trunc operates globally with infrastructure in multiple regions:</p><ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-gray-700 mb-6"><li><strong>Primary Hosting:</strong> United States (AWS us-east-1)</li><li><strong>CDN:</strong> Global edge locations for fast link redirects</li><li><strong>Data Residency:</strong> Available for Enterprise customers (contact sales)</li><li><strong>EU Data Protection:</strong> Standard Contractual Clauses (SCCs) for EU data transfers</li><li><strong>Privacy Shield:</strong> Compliant with EU-US and Swiss-US data transfer frameworks</li></ul><p class="text-gray-700">By using Trunc from outside the United States, you consent to data transfer and processing in accordance with this policy.</p></section><section><h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-4">9. Children''s Privacy (COPPA Compliance)</h2><p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">Trunc is not intended for children under 13 years of age:</p><ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-gray-700 mb-4"><li>We do not knowingly collect information from children under 13</li><li>We do not market our services to children</li><li>If we discover a child account, we will delete it immediately</li><li>Parents can contact us at <a href="mailto:privacy@urlshorter.com" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">privacy@urlshorter.com</a> to request deletion</li></ul><p class="text-gray-700">For users ages 13-17, we recommend parental supervision and consent.</p></section><section><h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-4">10. Third-Party Links and Services</h2><p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">Our service allows you to create short links to any destination URL:</p><ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-gray-700 mb-4"><li><strong>Not Responsible:</strong> We are not responsible for the privacy practices of destination websites</li><li><strong>Link Scanning:</strong> We scan for malware but do not review privacy policies</li><li><strong>User Responsibility:</strong> You are responsible for the URLs you share</li><li><strong>Third-Party Integrations:</strong> Zapier, Slack, and other integrations have their own privacy policies</li></ul><div class="bg-red-50 border border-red-200 rounded-lg p-4"><p class="text-red-800"><strong>Warning:</strong> Clicking on a Trunc short link will redirect you to a third-party website. Review the destination website''s privacy policy before providing personal information.</p></div></section><section><h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-4">11. Changes to This Privacy Policy</h2><p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">We may update this policy periodically. Material changes will be communicated via:</p><ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-gray-700 mb-6"><li>Email notification to your registered email address (30 days before effective date)</li><li>Dashboard banner announcement</li><li>Updated "Last updated" date at the top of this page</li><li>Change history available at the bottom of this page</li></ul><p class="text-gray-700 mb-4"><strong>Your Options:</strong></p><ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-gray-700"><li>Review changes and continue using the service (acceptance of new terms)</li><li>Opt-out by deleting your account before changes take effect</li><li>Contact us with concerns at <a href="mailto:privacy@urlshorter.com" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">privacy@urlshorter.com</a></li></ul></section><section class="bg-gray-50 p-6 rounded-lg"><h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-4">12. Contact Us and Data Protection</h2><p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">For privacy questions, data requests, or concerns:</p><div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 mb-6"><div><h4 class="font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-2">Privacy Team</h4><p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mb-2"><strong>Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:privacy@urlshorter.com" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">privacy@urlshorter.com</a></p><p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mb-2"><strong>Response Time:</strong> Within 48 hours</p><p class="text-sm text-gray-600"><strong>Data Requests:</strong> Processed within 30 days</p></div><div><h4 class="font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-2">Data Protection Officer</h4><p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mb-2"><strong>Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:dpo@urlshorter.com" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">dpo@urlshorter.com</a></p><p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mb-2"><strong>Address:</strong> Trunc Technologies</p><p class="text-sm text-gray-600">123 Tech Boulevard, San Francisco, CA 94105</p></div></div><div class="bg-blue-50 border border-blue-200 rounded-lg p-4"><p class="text-blue-900 text-sm"><strong>Transparency Report:</strong> We publish an annual transparency report detailing government requests and data disclosures. View at <a href="https://trunc.com/transparency" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">trunc.com/transparency</a></p></div></section></div></div>', 'Read our privacy policy to learn how we protect and handle your data.', NULL, true, false, 'default', 'en', 7),
('terms', 'Terms of Service', '<div class="space-y-8"><div class="text-center border-b border-gray-200 pb-8"><h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Terms of Service</h1><p class="text-lg text-gray-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto">Please read these Terms of Service carefully before using Trunc. By accessing or using our service, you agree to be bound by these terms.</p><p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mt-4"><strong>Last updated:</strong> January 16, 2026</p></div><div class="space-y-10"><section><h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-4">1. Acceptance of Terms</h2><p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">By accessing and using Trunc ("Service"), you accept and agree to be bound by the terms and provisions of this agreement. If you do not agree to these Terms of Service, please do not use our Service.</p><p class="text-gray-700">These terms apply to all users of the Service, including without limitation users who are browsers, vendors, customers, merchants, and/or contributors of content.</p></section><section><h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-4">2. Description of Service</h2><p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">Trunc provides a URL shortening service that allows users to:</p><ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-gray-700"><li>Convert long URLs into shorter, more manageable links</li><li>Track analytics and statistics for shortened URLs</li><li>Customize short URLs with custom aliases</li><li>Access API endpoints for programmatic URL shortening</li><li>Manage and organize shortened links through a dashboard</li><li>Monitor click data, geographic information, and referrer sources</li></ul></section><section><h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-4">3. User Accounts and Registration</h2><h3 class="text-xl font-medium text-gray-800 mb-3">3.1 Account Creation</h3><p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">To access certain features of our Service, you must register for an account. When you register, you agree to:</p><ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-gray-700 mb-6"><li>Provide accurate, current, and complete information</li><li>Maintain and promptly update your account information</li><li>Maintain the security of your password and account</li><li>Accept responsibility for all activities under your account</li><li>Notify us immediately of any unauthorized use of your account</li></ul><h3 class="text-xl font-medium text-gray-800 mb-3">3.2 Account Eligibility</h3><p class="text-gray-700">You must be at least 13 years old to use our Service. By registering, you represent and warrant that you meet this age requirement and have the legal capacity to enter into these terms.</p></section><section><h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-4">4. Acceptable Use Policy</h2><p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">You agree to use Trunc only for lawful purposes and in a way that does not infringe upon the rights of others or restrict their use and enjoyment of the Service.</p><div class="bg-yellow-50 border border-yellow-200 rounded-lg p-4"><p class="text-yellow-900 font-semibold mb-2">You must NOT use our Service to:</p><ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-yellow-900"><li>Shorten URLs that link to illegal content, malware, or phishing sites</li><li>Distribute spam, viruses, or any malicious code</li><li>Violate any applicable laws or regulations</li><li>Infringe upon intellectual property rights of others</li><li>Harass, threaten, or harm others</li><li>Engage in fraudulent or deceptive practices</li><li>Bypass our security measures or abuse our service infrastructure</li></ul></div></section><section><h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-4">5. Prohibited Activities</h2><p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">The following activities are strictly prohibited:</p><div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-4"><div class="bg-red-50 border border-red-200 rounded-lg p-4"><h4 class="font-semibold text-red-900 mb-2">Content Violations</h4><ul class="list-disc pl-4 space-y-1 text-red-800 text-sm"><li>Adult content or pornography</li><li>Hate speech or discriminatory content</li><li>Violence or graphic content</li><li>Copyright infringement</li></ul></div><div class="bg-red-50 border border-red-200 rounded-lg p-4"><h4 class="font-semibold text-red-900 mb-2">Security Violations</h4><ul class="list-disc pl-4 space-y-1 text-red-800 text-sm"><li>Phishing or social engineering</li><li>Malware distribution</li><li>System hacking attempts</li><li>Unauthorized access</li></ul></div><div class="bg-red-50 border border-red-200 rounded-lg p-4"><h4 class="font-semibold text-red-900 mb-2">Abuse</h4><ul class="list-disc pl-4 space-y-1 text-red-800 text-sm"><li>Spam or unsolicited messages</li><li>Rate limiting bypass</li><li>Service disruption attempts</li><li>Resource abuse</li></ul></div><div class="bg-red-50 border border-red-200 rounded-lg p-4"><h4 class="font-semibold text-red-900 mb-2">Illegal Activities</h4><ul class="list-disc pl-4 space-y-1 text-red-800 text-sm"><li>Illegal goods or services</li><li>Money laundering</li><li>Identity theft</li><li>Fraud or scams</li></ul></div></div></section><section><h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-4">6. Intellectual Property Rights</h2><h3 class="text-xl font-medium text-gray-800 mb-3">6.1 Our Content</h3><p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">All content on Trunc, including but not limited to text, graphics, logos, icons, images, audio clips, digital downloads, and software, is the property of Trunc or its content suppliers and is protected by international copyright laws.</p><h3 class="text-xl font-medium text-gray-800 mb-3">6.2 Trademarks</h3><p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">The Trunc name and logo are trademarks of Trunc. You may not use our trademarks without our prior written consent.</p><h3 class="text-xl font-medium text-gray-800 mb-3">6.3 User License</h3><p class="text-gray-700">We grant you a limited, non-exclusive, non-transferable license to access and use our Service for personal or internal business purposes, subject to these Terms.</p></section><section><h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-4">7. User Content and Links</h2><p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">When you submit URLs for shortening, you retain ownership of the original content. However, you grant us:</p><ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-gray-700 mb-4"><li>The right to store and process your URLs for service operation</li><li>The right to display analytics and statistics related to your links</li><li>The right to remove links that violate these Terms</li></ul><p class="text-gray-700 mb-4"><strong>You are solely responsible for:</strong></p><ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-gray-700"><li>All URLs you submit to our Service</li><li>Ensuring you have the right to share destination URLs</li><li>The content at the destination of your shortened links</li><li>Compliance with applicable laws regarding your links</li></ul></section><section><h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-4">8. Service Availability and Modifications</h2><p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">We strive to provide reliable service, but we cannot guarantee uninterrupted access. We reserve the right to:</p><ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-gray-700"><li>Modify or discontinue the Service at any time with or without notice</li><li>Impose limits on certain features or restrict access to parts of the Service</li><li>Perform maintenance and updates that may temporarily interrupt service</li><li>Change our pricing, features, or service offerings</li></ul><p class="text-gray-700 mt-4">We will make reasonable efforts to notify users of significant changes or extended maintenance periods.</p></section><section><h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-4">9. Payment Terms</h2><h3 class="text-xl font-medium text-gray-800 mb-3">9.1 Subscription Plans</h3><p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">Certain features and services may require payment. By subscribing to a paid plan, you agree to:</p><ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-gray-700 mb-6"><li>Pay all fees associated with your selected plan</li><li>Provide accurate and complete billing information</li><li>Authorize recurring charges for subscription renewals</li><li>Pay any applicable taxes</li></ul><h3 class="text-xl font-medium text-gray-800 mb-3">9.2 Billing and Renewals</h3><p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">Subscriptions automatically renew unless cancelled before the renewal date. You can cancel your subscription at any time through your account settings.</p><h3 class="text-xl font-medium text-gray-800 mb-3">9.3 Refunds</h3><p class="text-gray-700">Refunds are handled on a case-by-case basis. Please contact our support team to discuss refund requests. We reserve the right to refuse refunds for services already rendered.</p></section><section><h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-4">10. Disclaimers and Limitations of Liability</h2><div class="bg-gray-50 border border-gray-300 rounded-lg p-6"><h3 class="text-xl font-medium text-gray-800 mb-3">10.1 Service "As Is"</h3><p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">THE SERVICE IS PROVIDED "AS IS" AND "AS AVAILABLE" WITHOUT WARRANTIES OF ANY KIND, EITHER EXPRESS OR IMPLIED, INCLUDING BUT NOT LIMITED TO IMPLIED WARRANTIES OF MERCHANTABILITY, FITNESS FOR A PARTICULAR PURPOSE, OR NON-INFRINGEMENT.</p><h3 class="text-xl font-medium text-gray-800 mb-3">10.2 No Warranty</h3><p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">We do not warrant that:</p><ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-gray-700 mb-4"><li>The Service will meet your specific requirements</li><li>The Service will be uninterrupted, timely, secure, or error-free</li><li>The results obtained from using the Service will be accurate or reliable</li><li>Any errors in the Service will be corrected</li></ul><h3 class="text-xl font-medium text-gray-800 mb-3">10.3 Limitation of Liability</h3><p class="text-gray-700">TO THE MAXIMUM EXTENT PERMITTED BY LAW, TRUNC SHALL NOT BE LIABLE FOR ANY INDIRECT, INCIDENTAL, SPECIAL, CONSEQUENTIAL, OR PUNITIVE DAMAGES, OR ANY LOSS OF PROFITS OR REVENUES, WHETHER INCURRED DIRECTLY OR INDIRECTLY, OR ANY LOSS OF DATA, USE, GOODWILL, OR OTHER INTANGIBLE LOSSES RESULTING FROM YOUR USE OF THE SERVICE.</p></div></section><section><h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-4">11. Indemnification</h2><p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">You agree to indemnify, defend, and hold harmless Trunc and its officers, directors, employees, and agents from and against any claims, liabilities, damages, losses, and expenses, including reasonable legal fees, arising out of or in any way connected with:</p><ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-gray-700"><li>Your access to or use of the Service</li><li>Your violation of these Terms</li><li>Your violation of any third-party rights, including intellectual property rights</li><li>Your URLs or the content they link to</li><li>Any harm caused to third parties through your use of the Service</li></ul></section><section><h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-4">12. Termination</h2><h3 class="text-xl font-medium text-gray-800 mb-3">12.1 By You</h3><p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">You may terminate your account at any time by contacting us or using the account deletion feature in your settings.</p><h3 class="text-xl font-medium text-gray-800 mb-3">12.2 By Us</h3><p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">We reserve the right to suspend or terminate your account and access to the Service at any time, with or without notice, for any reason, including but not limited to:</p><ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-gray-700 mb-4"><li>Violation of these Terms</li><li>Fraudulent or illegal activity</li><li>Abusive behavior toward other users or staff</li><li>Extended period of inactivity</li><li>Request by law enforcement or government agencies</li></ul><h3 class="text-xl font-medium text-gray-800 mb-3">12.3 Effect of Termination</h3><p class="text-gray-700">Upon termination, your right to use the Service will immediately cease. All shortened URLs associated with your account may be deactivated or deleted. We are not liable for any loss or damage resulting from termination of your account.</p></section><section><h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-4">13. Governing Law and Dispute Resolution</h2><h3 class="text-xl font-medium text-gray-800 mb-3">13.1 Governing Law</h3><p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">These Terms shall be governed by and construed in accordance with the laws of the State of California, United States, without regard to its conflict of law provisions.</p><h3 class="text-xl font-medium text-gray-800 mb-3">13.2 Dispute Resolution</h3><p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">Any dispute arising from these Terms or your use of the Service shall be resolved through:</p><ol class="list-decimal pl-6 space-y-2 text-gray-700"><li><strong>Informal Resolution:</strong> Contact us at legal@urlshorter.com to attempt to resolve the dispute informally</li><li><strong>Binding Arbitration:</strong> If informal resolution fails, disputes will be resolved through binding arbitration in accordance with the rules of the American Arbitration Association</li><li><strong>Class Action Waiver:</strong> You agree to resolve disputes on an individual basis and waive any right to participate in a class action lawsuit</li></ol></section><section><h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-4">14. Changes to Terms</h2><p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">We reserve the right to modify these Terms at any time. We will notify users of material changes by:</p><ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-gray-700 mb-4"><li>Posting the updated Terms on our website</li><li>Sending email notifications to registered users</li><li>Displaying a prominent notice in the Service</li></ul><p class="text-gray-700">Your continued use of the Service after any changes constitutes acceptance of the new Terms. If you do not agree to the modified Terms, you must stop using the Service.</p></section><section><h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-4">15. Miscellaneous</h2><h3 class="text-xl font-medium text-gray-800 mb-3">15.1 Entire Agreement</h3><p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">These Terms constitute the entire agreement between you and Trunc regarding the use of the Service.</p><h3 class="text-xl font-medium text-gray-800 mb-3">15.2 Severability</h3><p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">If any provision of these Terms is found to be unenforceable or invalid, that provision will be limited or eliminated to the minimum extent necessary so that these Terms will otherwise remain in full force and effect.</p><h3 class="text-xl font-medium text-gray-800 mb-3">15.3 Waiver</h3><p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">Our failure to enforce any right or provision of these Terms will not be considered a waiver of those rights.</p><h3 class="text-xl font-medium text-gray-800 mb-3">15.4 Assignment</h3><p class="text-gray-700">You may not assign or transfer these Terms or your rights hereunder without our prior written consent. We may assign these Terms without restriction.</p></section><section class="bg-gray-50 p-6 rounded-lg"><h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-4">16. Contact Us</h2><p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">If you have any questions about these Terms of Service, please contact us:</p><div class="space-y-2 text-gray-700"><p><strong>Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:legal@urlshorter.com" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">legal@urlshorter.com</a></p><p><strong>Support:</strong> <a href="mailto:support@urlshorter.com" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">support@urlshorter.com</a></p><p><strong>Address:</strong> Trunc Technologies, 123 Tech Boulevard, San Francisco, CA 94105</p><p><strong>Phone:</strong> <a href="tel:+1-555-0123" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">+1 (555) 012-3456</a></p></div><div class="bg-blue-50 border border-blue-200 rounded-lg p-4 mt-6"><p class="text-blue-900 text-sm"><strong>Important:</strong> By using Trunc, you acknowledge that you have read, understood, and agree to be bound by these Terms of Service and our Privacy Policy.</p></div></section></div></div>', 'Review our terms of service before using the platform.', NULL, true, false, 'default', 'en', 8),
